* {{l|ru|негро́ид}}
* {{l|ru|черножо́пый}} {{q|vulgar, derogatory, offensive}}
* {{l|ru|черноко́жий}}
* {{l|ru|чернома́зый}} {{q|vulgar, derogatory, offensive}}
* {{l|ru|чёрный|lit=black}} {{q|can be offensive, although it's more commonly used to describe the natives of Caucasus}}

